Brand automation triggers and schedule
title end

paragraph start
An automation starts from a trigger, such as a new asset added, a draft ready for review or a weekly check. Only repeatable steps are automated.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Each automation is written down with its trigger, its steps, its schedule and the person who checks the result.
paragraph end

code start
